      "title": "Cupe - Automne 2026 - Assistanat de recherche - J. Fathally",
      "description": "Start date: 2026-09-11\nPosted: Posted 3 Days Ago\nPart time\n\nPosting Reason: New Position Location where work is to be performed: Main Campus Session: 2026 Fall Semester | Trimestre d'automne Faculty: Section de droit civil / Civil Law Section Unit: Jabeur Fathally_Students Job Classification: Research Assistant (CUPE) Posting Type: Recherche / Research Course Title: N\\A Course Code: N\\A Section: Supervisor name (if known): Date Posted (YYYY/MM/DD): 2026/09/11 Applications must be received BEFORE (YYYY/MM/DD): 2026/09/20 Description of tasks (hours): Unless specified below, specific allocation of hours to various tasks should be articulated in a description of work negotiated and signed by you and the supervising professor prior to the commencement of work. Recherche / Research:134 Préparation / Preparation:0 Contact avec étudiants / Contact with Students:0 Correction - Notation / Grading:0 Surveillance / Proctoring:0 Formation / Training:0 Autre / Other:0 Number of positions: 1 Expected Enrolment: N\\A Work Start Date: September 16, 2026 Work End Date: April 30, 2027 Total Work Hours: 134 Hourly Rate: AE-RA-Tuteur / TA-RA-Tutor : $33.83 ou/or $53.31 (Sept. 2026 - Aug. 2027) The academic year starts on September 1 and ends on August 31. Undergraduate students will be paid at the lower rate; while graduate students will be paid at the higher rate. These rates do not included vacation pay nor statutory pay. These rates will be applied until a new collective agreement is ratified. Retro will be paid after the ratification. Language of Work: Anglais | English, Français | French Requirements and Nature of Work: Description :  Le candidat recherché doit  remplir les exigences suivantes: 1.Avoir une excellente connaissance des outils informatiques nécessaires à la gestion d'une base de données et à la création de cartes et graphiques 2. Avoir suivi et réussi le cours de droit comparé ( les grands systèmes de droit contemporains) ainsi qu'un cours